{"source":"github","project_id":"chattr","target":"mlverse/chattr","id":"pr/107","ref":107,"title":"Add support for GPT-4 Omni","description":"Hi! I do not know what is the preferrable way to contribute to this great package. However, I wanted to use it with the latest OpenAI model GPT-4 Omni, so I forked the repo and added the apropriate config file. It seems that it is enough to use the new model (I can use the new model on my laptop). If it is enough, you can merge this pull request so that other people can use it too ;)","published_at":"2024-05-21T15:46:59Z","updated_at":"2024-05-21T18:41:27Z","url":"https://github.com/mlverse/chattr/pull/107","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"pawelqs","merged_at":"2024-05-21T18:41:27Z","state":"MERGED"}}
