{"source":"github","project_id":"chattr","target":"mlverse/chattr","id":"pr/82","ref":82,"title":"Updates","description":"* Complete retooling of the package, it simplifies integration\r\n* Going forward `ch_submit()` will be the only function that will be needed to integrate a new backend. It will only require the output of the model, and `cat()` the current results if streaming is set to `TRUE` \r\n* Removes DaVinci model, and the older \"completion\" methods (as opposed to the \"chat completion\" methods) which was only required for non GPT models \r\n* Fixes #31 \r\n","published_at":"2024-04-01T20:19:29Z","updated_at":"2024-04-01T20:40:30Z","url":"https://github.com/mlverse/chattr/pull/82","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"edgararuiz","merged_at":"2024-04-01T20:40:30Z","state":"MERGED"}}
